# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user
*.pdb

# IDE / tooling
.claude/settings.local.json
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo

# Installer build artifacts.
#   - installer/deps/  caches the downloaded OpenVPN MSI (~6 MB)
#   - installer/Output/ holds the produced VpnClientSetup-*.exe (~75 MB)
# Both are reproducible from source via installer/build.ps1.
/installer/deps/
/installer/Output/

# User-side secrets: .ovpn profiles imported by users (often hold private
# keys inline) and anything at the workspace root with that extension.
/*.ovpn
*.ovpn.bak

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Local portable build output (reproducible via cargo build + dotnet publish).
# Do not commit binaries.
/dist/
